Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:02.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續一副自以為了不起的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:03.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹不出什麼事來也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:05.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會遵守約定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:14.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那裡幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:19.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:23.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快　我幫你打開閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:39.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼生命只要有機會都會想要活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:42.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要走囉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長　Impulse它…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:00:59.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不想讓她死掉才來送還的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:03.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以絕對要向我保證
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:10.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不讓她再靠近戰爭和MS…這種與死亡相關的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:14.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回到平和溫暖的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:17.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保證
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:19.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:28.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是否該說感謝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:30.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這都無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:32.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　剛才說的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:33.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:35.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:40.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉她喜歡這個　所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:47.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘記 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘記我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:15.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-31  不明之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:03:59.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:03.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以違反軍法第三條及其後多項罪名逮捕你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告  已逮捕真 飛鳥並帶到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:33.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經做好覺悟的表情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:38.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷倒是很相信你  幸好確實回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:43.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過回來會怎樣  你心裡應該很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:48.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擅自釋放俘虜  對船員施以暴行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:52.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未經許可出動MS與敵軍接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:55.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,違反軍紀至此  簡直前所未聞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得那女孩很可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:03.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:05.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長應該也很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:10.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:13.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是聯合軍的強化人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但史黛拉也是人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:17.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卻那樣對她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:22.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼解剖時數據會難以取得什麼的 這個 那個的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:25.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都不在乎她會死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:27.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍很過份
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但艦長你們也是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:31.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真  注意言辭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:38.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算如此  你的所作所為也不能被承認
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事實上因為她是聯合軍的強化人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:48.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須帶她至直布羅陀  這是司令部的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:53.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因個人私心而違背命令  是不可原諒的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:58.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事必須報告司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,處分隨後傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:01.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥和雷 查 巴勒路同樣關禁閉處理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:11.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.78,0:06:38.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:40.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:43.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  因為
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒理由向我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:50.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是按自己的意願行事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:54.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,平安送回去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:55.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:07.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:10.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:20.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到你那麼在意她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:25.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  其實也不怎麼在意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是覺得這樣很討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉也是受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:36.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而大家都忘了這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只把她當作聯合軍的強化人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:41.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死了也無所謂似的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:46.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那也是事實
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她身為聯合軍的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:54.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,殺害了無數ZAFT士兵也是事實
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:56.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是史黛拉並不是自願那麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她和自願入伍的我們不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:13.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那可能更不該把她送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然無法憑自己的意志離開戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:20.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好又會再次…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是說就那樣讓她死去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:28.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣　但這樣無法解決任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:31.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉那麼痛苦  那麼害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:32.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:34.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那個人向我保證了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:40.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會把史黛拉帶回遠離戰場的平和世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你就能說自己沒做錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:48.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真  夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭也別說了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:54.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在說這種話也無濟於事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:56.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過去的事就讓它過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:01.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未來的事還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說也沒意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:07.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只能一邊祈禱著一邊等待明天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:09.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們大家都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.51,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(648,708)}{\fad(500,0)}俄羅斯平原
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:26.76,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(636,628)}{\fad(500,500)}地球聯合軍 地上航母 邦那巴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:29.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是第八宙域獨立軌道軍  尼歐 羅阿諾克上校
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,邦那巴  收到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:34.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已傳送識別代號  請求登艦許可
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是邦那巴  了解
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:39.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認識別代號  羅阿諾克上校
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:40.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請登艦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:57.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又帶我們到這種鳥不生蛋的地方來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:00.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來  這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:04.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛還帶這種半死不活的來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:05.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不知道的事太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:14.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今不知道也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都會看走眼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:29.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來Minerva對你來說負擔太重了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才在考慮該如何處理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:39.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸虧Destroy已經完成  就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:45.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若你們能擊敗Minerva  本來不需要這種作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:46.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:51.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,腐爛的部分不盡早除掉就會擴散
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:56.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用那個盡快擺平歐亞西部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:01.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次應該沒問題了吧  尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:10.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,浮上完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,推進力轉移
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:14.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,周邊無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:16.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距目標點約90
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過很冷的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:21.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實很冷  北歐峽灣的碼頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:24.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以Archangel上有溫泉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:26.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:33.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真沒想到斯堪迪納維亞王國會幫忙藏身
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:37.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有國王陛下和極少數人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但真的感到很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還記得父親的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:50.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,受到地球軍攻擊時  那個國家也立即提供了援助呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:55.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在還只能受到大家的保護
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括你們在內
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:11:59.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現在請讓我依靠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:07.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天我一定會報恩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:11.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:15.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就像父親一樣  做一個永不放棄的優秀執政者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:19.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們追隨你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:22.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布國內  也有很多人反對賽蘭的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:26.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,衷心期待卡嘉莉小姐的回歸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我雖然不懂政治
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:34.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這場戰爭無論怎麼看都是聯合軍在煽風點火
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:38.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說現在加入其陣營的奧布  這樣下去也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:41.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,賽蘭太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:43.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:46.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白  所以請大家再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:51.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望盡快回奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:56.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了各位和在克列塔犧牲的將士們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:01.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以現在  請再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等到時機來臨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到那時再借我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:10.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了奧布  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:10.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:11.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:12.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能打擾一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:31.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  在這裡偷懶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:33.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:37.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次你一個人已經很努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:40.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:49.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想著不知為什麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼又演變成要和阿斯蘭戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:58.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們錯了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道真的像阿斯蘭說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:07.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長是好人  拉克絲被襲擊也是有什麼誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:14.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是愚蠢或錯誤的行為
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:15.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉君
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:20.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過保護重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:25.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不是愚蠢或錯誤的行為
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世事的確難以預料
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:33.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我認為有珍惜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:38.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這世界才更為可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪硫艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定都是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會努力戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:46.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是處理方法上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:53.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或者說想法會有所不同
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:57.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直到意識到某人對自己這個世界的重要性
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:06.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭想保護什麼的心情肯定也相同
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:10.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會更加艱難
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:17.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但你們肯定又會有牽起手來的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:20.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以別放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要以自己的方式加油
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:24.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:36.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳的新機體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉的新…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:44.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  史黛拉今後又得戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:48.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然可怕的東西會來殺死我們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,殺死…史黛拉?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐也會?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:00.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:05.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:08.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好好幹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:11.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉的話一定能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:14.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的東西都必須除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:17.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:44.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令部發給艦長的特別一號密電
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真會被怎麼處理呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:50.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一般情況下是被槍斃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:56.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果考慮到真至今為止的戰績
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,起碼不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,生體CPU連接情況良好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:10.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們未能防患未然也會被問責
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:18.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急工作人員待機
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:21.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,X-1 Destroy平台閘門開啟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:49.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我們也出發
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:52.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不給我開那個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:56.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比起那種來歷不明又大病初癒的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:57.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:58.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是適應性
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:04.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉的效率較好  數據上就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:19.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:25.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拘留中的強化人逃跑後死亡一事確實遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:29.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但考慮到貴艦至今為止的功績和當前戰況
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:32.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對於本次事件不予追究責任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:38.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不追究?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:40.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:41.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令部說的?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:43.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是超級王牌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:46.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:48.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:50.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擔心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:59.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉讓你們擔心  已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:01.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:03.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.91,0:20:39.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候真的慌了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:43.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長  線人來的緊急信號
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令部發來的緊急通告
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,歐亞中部的地球軍進攻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.31,0:21:21.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已有三座城市被毀滅
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:24.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT全軍進入非常警戒狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:25.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:30.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:33.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:37.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令部似乎也有了解我的人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:42.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說明你所謂的正確並不代表一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:47.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧  瑪硫艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:48.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:53.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:55.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:03.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,必須除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.73,0:22:06.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把可怕的東西…全部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:25.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,火焰中浮現出巨大的牆壁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:27.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壓倒性的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:31.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,忘記溫柔臂膀酌雙目中映照出的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.19,0:23:33.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是只有恐怖的世界嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:38.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各自揮落的劍下  拯救的東西是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.57,0:23:43.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.81,0:23:45.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:49.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,斬破黑暗的天空  Freedom
